what is isolation and propogation 

isolation-> if two thread accesing the method which is annoted with transaction how you want to reflect the transaction between this two thread can be achieve 
with isolation

5 type of isolation
DEFAUL
READ_UNCOMMITED
READ_COMMITED
REPETABLE_READ
SERIALIZABLE


propagation ->

there is method m1 annotated with transaction and inside m1() there is m2()

if m2() fail then you want to rollback or continue 
or if m2() is successful but error in m1() then what rollback or continue
this is achieved by propagation

propagation types
REQUIRED
SUPPORTS
MANDATORY
REQUIRES_NEW
NOT_SUPPORTED
NEVER
NESTED


